## 2. Architecture
OML ceramic face (CER-B / CER-W) → densified IML + CER-WP → ADH-F 0.15–0.25 mm → hemp core 6–10 mm, edge-sealed → ADH-F → S-glass backing + Ti / FeNi doubler → HUT / exo lattice → bladder + restraint + LCVG

Load path is lattice, never ceramic, never hemp.
Rear hatch is the door. Helmet is not the door.
Pack last at don. SEAs OPEN during step-in.
V-EBM HV inhibited in air.

Datums:
- A — HUT sternum plane
- B — sagital midplane
- C — hatch-ring upper bolt plane

Sternum hard points S1–S4: M8, 52 mm from center, 18 mm off midplane, plus 6 mm 12 o’clock pin.

