## 6. Joints and actuators

| Layer | Hardware | Use |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | Springs + clutches | Suit-torque cancel. Fail OPEN |
| 1 | Rotary SEA hip, knee | Walk / kneel. OPEN at don and entry |
