| V-EBM | PI vacuum-gap cells | Plate and visor latches in hard vac |

Torque order: elbow ~15–18 Nm, knee ~30–40 Nm, hip flex ~40–70 Nm.
Impedance on EVA. HOLD on landing spike and entry. OPEN on step-in.

