## 8. Step-in (rear hatch)

1. Suit on stand, hatch open, pack off or swung, SEAs OPEN, HV off.
2. Feet, sit into pelvic yoke, arms, hatch, pack, helmet, gloves.
3. Pack-last. No weight on CAP-S. No third person aiming a foot.
4. Full two-person 1 g first article ≤ 4 min.

