## 9. Manufacturing (chest family, short)

Parallel streams: ceramic faces → hemp cores → backing/doubler → bond → cup → spider → mate to HUT.

Hemp cores: bake / degum / bake / impregnate Route A prepreg (PI or phenolic) / layup / cure / edge seal / outgas bake / serial.
Chest bore: core stops at sealed land. No bast in the cup.
First article: three-facet plastron + bore coupon + 2× Case A on dummy HUT.

